the rest (node-a 607 of 685 s, web-tw5 1,826 of 1,913 s). Per-job setup overhead stays small beside suite time.

Held-out workflow (`held-out.yml`, every code push to develop and main): 24 cells, 5,640 job-seconds, about 19 to 20 min
